action,x,y,origin,button,key,micros,note,platform
# P2 on WinUI. The coordinates are WinUI's own layout, in frame DIPs, measured
# 2026-11-13 from a 125% capture: (capture px + 8 px left border) / 1.25. The
# file it replaces held GtkBackend's layout, where "Set 12345" sits at y=295; on
# WinUI that point is inside the TextEditor below it, so all five clicks missed
# and the run still ended rc 0. GtkBackend keeps those coordinates in
# P2-controls-and-resizing-gtk4.actions.
# P2 於 WinUI。座標是 WinUI 自己的版面，以外框 DIP 計，2026-11-13 由 125% 截圖量得：(截圖 px + 左邊框 8 px) / 1.25。
# 它取代的檔案用的是 GtkBackend 的版面，「Set 12345」在 y=295;在 WinUI 上那一點落在下方的 TextEditor 裡，五下全部
# 沒點到，執行卻仍以 rc 0 結束。GtkBackend 的座標保留在 P2-controls-and-resizing-gtk4.actions。
click,66,263,frame,left,,,"Set 12345" -- Length becomes 5,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
click,145,263,frame,left,,,"Clear" -- Length becomes 0,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
click,122,106,frame,left,,,"Use expanded Picker options" -- options must grow (#449),windows
sleep,,,,,,900000,,windows
click,92,491,frame,left,,,"Enable button row" -- the disabled row becomes live,windows
sleep,,,,,,800000,,windows
click,103,662,frame,left,,,"Allow window resizing" -- the maximise button must return (#401),windows
sleep,,,,,,1800000,hold for the capture,windows
